# 统一换行符：仓库与工作区一律 LF（Prettier 默认 endOfLine: lf），
# 覆盖各开发者本地的 core.autocrlf 配置（Windows Git 安装默认 true，
# 检出转 CRLF 会导致 eslint-prettier 全线报 Delete ␍）。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件显式排除，防止文本换行转换破坏内容
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
